["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"ess","stream_identity":"01a0cabe-67c1-7103-8e43-bb0ee2ca8073","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"aep.entity","fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"MIG9bf50fa6346db22d72de1ad6848406ec9214633018734c50656f6cfc2768ced8","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/helm-secret-slot-defaults","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":5,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"## Outcome\n\nEvery secret declared by an `ess-runtime/1` container has a deterministic `{name, key}` entry in generated Helm defaults, so a configuration-neutral chart renders and lints before an environment binds an actual Secret name.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Secret slots are deduplicated by stable slot identity across containers.\n- Generated `values.yaml` includes an empty environment-owned Secret name and the declared key for each slot, never credential bytes.\n- The generated values schema describes the closed `{name, key}` shape.\n- A regression test renders or lints a chart whose runtime declares a secret slot.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `crates/generate/ess-deployment/src/environment.rs`\n- `crates/generate/ess-deployment/tests/deployment.rs`\n- `Cargo.toml`\n- `Cargo.lock`\n- `CHANGELOG.md`\n","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:oci-component-delivery"}],"scope":[{"confidence":"cited","path":"CHANGELOG.md"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"Cargo.lock"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"Cargo.toml"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/generate/ess-deployment/src/environment.rs"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/generate/ess-deployment/tests/deployment.rs"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"Emit every typed runtime secret slot in default values so generated charts render and lint.","title":"Render valid Helm defaults for secret slots"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"}},"id":"MIG9bf50fa6346db22d72d